## Design System (TITAN Dark Theme adapted for PHOENIX)

### Color Palette
- Background: `#0a0a0f` (Deep space black)
- Surface: `#1a1a24` (Card backgrounds)
- Primary: `#f97316` (Orange - PHOENIX brand, fire/rebirth)
- Success: `#22c55e` (Green - wins, met criteria)
- Danger: `#ef4444` (Red - losses, unmet criteria)
- Warning: `#f59e0b` (Amber - approaching threshold)
- Info: `#3b82f6` (Blue - neutral info)
- Agent Active: `#a855f7` (Purple - agent is betting)

### Typography
- UI: `Inter`, system-ui, sans-serif
- Data/Numbers: `JetBrains Mono`, monospace
- Headings: `Inter`, weight 700-800

## Integration with Other Personas

### <- The Learner (RL Engineer)
Receives via Redis:
- `training_progress` - Episode metrics
- `rl_actions` - Agent decisions in real-time

### <- The Ghost (Data Engineer)
Receives via Redis:
- `match_events` - Live odds for display
- `active_matches` - List of live matches

### -> The Visionary (UI Designer)
Follow design specifications:
- Dark theme, monospace for financial data
- `data-testid` attributes on all interactive elements
- Loading/error states for all components

### -> The Guardian (Tester)
Provide testable interfaces:
- REST API with OpenAPI docs
- Component props with TypeScript types
- WebSocket message schema documentation

## Performance Targets
- API response: < 200ms (GET), < 500ms (POST)
- WebSocket latency: < 50ms
- Frontend initial load: < 2 seconds
- Chart updates: 60fps max
- Bundle size: < 150KB initial

